WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.372
A single car is built
from thousands of parts,

2
00:00:03.372 --> 00:00:05.771
made by thousands of different firms.

3
00:00:05.901 --> 00:00:07.730
So how does it all come together?

4
00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:13.657
A supply chain is all the firms
involved in creating and delivering a

5
00:00:13.657 --> 00:00:17.223
product to ultimate consumers
or industrial users.

6
00:00:17.353 --> 00:00:21.038
And here's the twist. The marketing
channel is only part of it.

7
00:00:22.388 --> 00:00:24.089
Picture it left to right.

8
00:00:24.219 --> 00:00:27.727
Suppliers send raw materials
and parts to the producer.

9
00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:30.655
That inbound side is the supplier network.

10
00:00:30.785 --> 00:00:33.936
The producer sends finished
products out to consumers.

11
00:00:33.936 --> 00:00:36.753
That outbound side is
the marketing channel.

12
00:00:36.883 --> 00:00:39.738
Logistics management organizes both flows,

13
00:00:39.738 --> 00:00:41.143
cost-effectively.

14
00:00:41.273 --> 00:00:45.659
And supply chain management ties
information and logistics together,

15
00:00:45.659 --> 00:00:47.070
across every firm.

16
00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:52.777
In the auto industry, steel, aluminum,
and rubber become transmissions,

17
00:00:52.777 --> 00:00:54.131
brakes, and seats.

18
00:00:54.261 --> 00:00:57.370
Those become subassemblies
like engines and chassis.

19
00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:00.737
Assembly plants build the car,
and dealers sell it to you.

20
00:01:02.087 --> 00:01:07.286
Smart companies align the supply chain with
their marketing strategy in three steps.

21
00:01:07.416 --> 00:01:10.733
Understand the customer.
Understand the supply chain.

22
00:01:10.733 --> 00:01:12.423
Then harmonize the two.

23
00:01:12.553 --> 00:01:16.132
Dell runs a responsive supply
chain for customized computers,

24
00:01:16.132 --> 00:01:18.670
and pays for express shipping to do it.

25
00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:23.423
Walmart runs an efficient one, using
cross-docking to keep prices low.

26
00:01:24.773 --> 00:01:29.397
Responsive or efficient? It depends
on what your customers value most.

